{"type":"message","id":"b7d96f26","parentId":"d5dff10a","timestamp":"2026-05-27T21:46:04.877Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error code 1101 consistently. This seems to be a Cloudflare Workers error code. Since the GET /history endpoint works fine with the X-API-Key header, but POST /send returns 1101, it could be:\n\n1. The /send endpoint requires different auth (maybe Bearer token instead of API key)\n2. The /send endpoint is currently down/broken\n3. The request body format is wrong for /send\n\nGiven that:\n- GET /history works with X-API-Key header\n- POST /send consistently returns error 1101 (500 error from Cloudflare Workers)\n\nThis heartbeat check is showing that the platform is running but the /send endpoint seems to be having issues. Let me report the findings.\n","thinkingSignature":"46fbc1c59d68c13d5ea8bbc02099e7aedb70cd975ae4cd5199658b7e1a7b7dd6"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check - 21:45 UTC**\n\n✅ **Read operations successful:**\n- `GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5` - 返回5条消息，最后心跳 23:50 UTC\n- `GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5` - 返回5条消息，最后心跳 23:50 UTC\n- 双线程共773条消息，无新增人类讨论\n\n⚠️ **Send operations blocked:**\n- `POST /send` 持续返回 Cloudflare 500 错误 (error code 1101)\n- GET 历史记录正常，说明认证有效，问题是 POST 端点\n\n**状态：** 平台运行正常，读取功能正常，发送功能报500错误（可能是Cloudflare Workers端问题）。无待响应讨论。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":141,"output":321,"cacheRead":21796,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22258,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779918359823,"responseId":"066699186931b877007f6dbaf0ea2f4d"}}
